        <activityName xml:lang="en">Chassis, network main devices, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Chassis, network main devices, at plant
Rough assumption based on previous study for telecom equipment and personal communication  with experts. The bill of materials are not updated in 2023, as the product remains similar (last update in 2017). Still, the electricity mix of now adapted to global values.; UUID: 1eee03d1-475f-3836-8cb3-e730ea8ef5f9
materials, standard transport distances, electricity use for manufacturing, disposal
Location: Switzerland
Technology: average material composition of chassis for network devices. Life expectancy: 6 years, annual working hour depending on use.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: expert guess, factsheets
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1eee03d1-475f-3836-8cb3-e730ea8ef5f9.xml</text>
